{"audio": "1corinthians-13.opus", "duration_ms": 107083, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3961, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Thirteen."}, {"start_ms": 5221, "end_ms": 11743, "text": "If I speak in the tongues of men and of angels, but have not love, I am only a ringing gong or a clanging cymbal."}, {"start_ms": 12423, "end_ms": 22225, "text": "If I have the gift of prophecy and can fathom all mysteries and all knowledge, and if I have absolute faith so as to move mountains, but have not love, I am nothing."}, {"start_ms": 23065, "end_ms": 29806, "text": "If I give all I possess to the poor and exult in the surrender of my body, but have not love, I gain nothing."}, {"start_ms": 30667, "end_ms": 33627, "text": "Love is patient, love is kind."}, {"start_ms": 34207, "end_ms": 38168, "text": "It does not envy, it does not boast, it is not proud."}, {"start_ms": 38888, "end_ms": 45750, "text": "It is not rude, it is not self-seeking, it is not easily angered, it keeps no account of wrongs."}, {"start_ms": 46590, "end_ms": 50351, "text": "Love takes no pleasure in evil, but rejoices in the truth."}, {"start_ms": 51011, "end_ms": 56972, "text": "It bears all things, believes all things, hopes all things, endures all things."}, {"start_ms": 57832, "end_ms": 59133, "text": "Love never fails."}, {"start_ms": 59553, "end_ms": 67515, "text": "But where there are prophecies, they will cease; where there are tongues, they will be restrained; where there is knowledge, it will be dismissed."}, {"start_ms": 68255, "end_ms": 74696, "text": "For we know in part and we prophesy in part, but when the perfect comes, the partial passes away."}, {"start_ms": 75496, "end_ms": 81678, "text": "When I was a child, I talked like a child, I thought like a child, I reasoned like a child."}, {"start_ms": 82278, "end_ms": 85398, "text": "When I became a man, I set aside childish ways."}, {"start_ms": 86339, "end_ms": 92040, "text": "Now we see but a dim reflection as in a mirror; then we shall see face to face."}, {"start_ms": 92520, "end_ms": 97681, "text": "Now I know in part; then I shall know fully, even as I am fully known."}, {"start_ms": 98521, "end_ms": 105603, "text": "And now these three remain: faith, hope, and love; but the greatest of these is love."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2341, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2341, "e": 3001, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3101, "e": 3421, "si": 0}, {"t": "Thirteen.", "s": 3481, "e": 3961, "si": 0}, {"t": "If", "s": 5221, "e": 5301, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5441, "e": 5461, "si": 1}, {"t": "speak", "s": 5521, "e": 5821, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 5881, "e": 5941, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5961, "e": 6041, "si": 1}, {"t": "tongues", "s": 6121, "e": 6441, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 6501, "e": 6561, "si": 1}, {"t": "men", "s": 6641, "e": 6841, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 7022, "e": 7122, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7162, "e": 7222, "si": 1}, {"t": "angels,", "s": 7302, "e": 7782, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 7882, "e": 8002, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 8062, "e": 8262, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 8302, "e": 8462, "si": 1}, {"t": "love,", "s": 8542, "e": 8822, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 9082, "e": 9102, "si": 1}, {"t": "am", "s": 9142, "e": 9202, "si": 1}, {"t": "only", "s": 9242, "e": 9442, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 9662, "e": 9682, "si": 1}, {"t": "ringing", "s": 9822, "e": 10142, "si": 1}, {"t": "gong", "s": 10202, "e": 10522, "si": 1}, {"t": "or", "s": 10602, "e": 10682, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 10722, "e": 10742, "si": 1}, {"t": "clanging", "s": 10842, "e": 11302, "si": 1}, {"t": "cymbal.", "s": 11442, "e": 11743, "si": 1}, {"t": "If", "s": 12423, "e": 12523, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 12663, "e": 12683, "si": 2}, {"t": "have", "s": 12723, "e": 12863, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 12863, "e": 12943, "si": 2}, {"t": "gift", "s": 12983, "e": 13203, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 13243, "e": 13303, "si": 2}, {"t": "prophecy", "s": 13383, "e": 13883, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 14003, "e": 